sequenceDiagram
  title Submitting a diagram for approval on GitHub
  actor U as Architect
  participant A as API
  participant G as GitHub
  participant J as Status sync job
  actor R as Reviewer
  U->>A: POST /diagrams/:id/submission
  A->>A: Must-fix violations block the submission
  A->>G: Branch, commit README, Mermaid, SVG, standard and validator
  A->>G: Open the pull request
  G-->>A: PR number
  R->>G: Review, checks run the Canvas validator
  loop every 15 minutes, and on refresh in the editor
    J->>G: Pull request, reviews, checks
    J->>J: Merged is approved, closed is rejected
  end
  U->>A: Resubmit after changes
  A->>G: New commit on the same pull request (unchanged tree is up to date)
